<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-RAIN DELAYS START OF CZECH OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RAIN DELAYS START OF CZECH OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain delayed the start of the Czech Open women's tennis final on Sunday.</p>
<p>Marion Maruska of Austria and South Africa's Joanette Kruger left the court when rain fell as they were warming up.</p>
<p>A decision on whether to play the match on Sunday evening or on Monday morning would be made later, a tournament official said.</p>
</text>
